Hi {Owner},

I build booking sites for window cleaners around {City}. {Business Name} has glowing reviews, but no site where someone can count their windows, see a price and book.

I built a sample first: a pane-count quote, online booking, screen, track and hard-water add-ons, a recurring cleaning plan and a storefront route sign-up, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and price edits. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

